From 54d884036eddef587eafa08843303ef1b5cf103b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chenhui Zhao <chenhui.zhao@nxp.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 12:14:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] xdp-trafficgen: support XDP ETF

Add XDP ETF (Earliest TxTime First) mode to xdp-trafficgen, enabling
hardware-offloaded launch-time packet scheduling via AF_XDP sockets.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Chenhui Zhao <chenhui.zhao@nxp.com>
